38
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,759
Since you're willing to help me like this,

39
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:13,759
I guess

40
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,639
I can still use you for something.

41
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:17,479
As long as I can save my family,

42
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,400
