121
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:39,319
I'll take you...

122
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:39,680
Go!

123
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,120
Go!

124
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,040
Go away!

125
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:45,879
Your Highness,

126
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,720
the shadow guard we placed in Prince Rui's Mansion

127
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,360
suddenly reported that

128
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:49,519
Princess Consort of Rui

129
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:50,920
seems to have

130
