206
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,759
I'll wash them carefully.

207
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,560
Carefully.

208
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,240
You hurt me.

209
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,199
I'm sorry.

210
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,279
Sorry, let me blow on it.

211
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,439
Get away!

212
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:21,199
You useless girl!

213
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,279
Hurry up!

214
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:27,839
