244
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,320
She is indeed poisoned.

245
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:38,240
As for whether it is caused by taro powder,

246
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,159
I

247
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,480
can't make a conclusion for the time being.

248
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,639
These days,

249
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,919
