250
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,840
If she's truly mad, fine.

251
00:08:46,519 --> 00:08:47,279
But if she's faking it,

252
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,440
I'll make her pay for Lady Shen's death.

253
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:57,799
Zhiyan,

254
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,159
