286
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,840
He can easily shift all the blame

287
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,080
onto Dr. Liu.

288
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,120
At that time,

289
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,879
