291
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:09,639
That's true.

292
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:11,840
What should we do next?

293
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:14,120
Where are the things I asked you to hide?

294
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,200
Go away.

295
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,320
Go away.

296
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,000
Go away, bad guy.

297
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:18,480
Imperial Physician Liu,

298
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,360
are you okay?

299
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:19,639
This...

300
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:20,960
Princess,

301
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,120
do you remember?

302
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:25,320
I'm the Imperial Physician Liu who checks your pulse every day.

303
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:31,600
Miss.

304
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,320
Zhiyan.

305
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:39,919
I'm going out tonight.

306
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,559
You watch the door.

307
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,000
Don't let anyone find out.

308
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,039
Miss.

309
00:10:46,639 --> 00:10:48,360
You're leaving me alone again.

310
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,600
Don't worry.

311
00:10:50,159 --> 00:10:50,840
I'll be back as soon as possible.

312
00:10:59,600 --> 00:10:59,919
Your Highness.

313
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,000
Have you found General Xiao?

314
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:03,960
The shadow guard spotted him

315
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,000
near the outskirts.

316
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,039
However,

317
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:08,000
there seems to be another group looking for him.

318
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,840
We're not sure of their identities yet.

319
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:11,279
Regardless,

320
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:12,799
we must find Xiao Wei first.

321
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:13,360
Yes.

322
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:14,120
Let's go.

323
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:19,759
My lady,

324
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,960
please stop washing.

325
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,399
Your hands are all red.

326
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,279
His Highness will be worried

327
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:25,360
if he sees this.

328
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:25,960
His heart

329
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,960
must have been taken by that bitch.

330
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,279
He won't care about me anymore.

331
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,519
Who else

332
00:11:31,159 --> 00:11:32,799
can take my heart but you?

333
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:34,200
Your Highness.

334
00:11:34,679 --> 00:11:35,200
You can leave now.

335
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,159
Chuchu,

336
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:41,159
why are you so hot-tempered?

337
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,519
Even if you don't cherish your body,

338
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,279
I will be heartbroken.

339
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:49,159
Are you falling in love with Shen Suhe?

340
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,080
She is not as good as you.

341
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,399
How could I fall in love with her?

342
00:11:56,039 --> 00:11:57,919
Then why do you always help her bully me?

343
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,840
She is the daughter of the Prime Minister.

344
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,600
If she reports me

345
00:12:02,639 --> 00:12:03,480
to my father,

346
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,440
It's not good for me.

347
00:12:06,759 --> 00:12:07,080
Chuchu,

348
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,320
just bear with it for a while.

349
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,799
I promise you,

350
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:11,600
in less than a month,

351
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,080
Shen Suhe

352
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,159
and the entire Prime Minister's Residence

353
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:15,840
will have no chance to turn things around.

354
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:57,000
Take people to find Xiao Wei.

355
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:57,840
Your Highness,

356
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:58,759
I'll stay here to deal with them.

357
00:12:59,039 --> 00:12:59,320
No more talk!

358
00:12:59,360 --> 00:12:59,759
Go!

359
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:13,039
Split up!

360
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:13,799
Find General Xiao!

361
00:13:14,039 --> 00:13:14,600
Use the whistle as a signal!

362
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,200
Yes, sir!

363
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:34,720
[It's been hours.]

364
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:40,080
[It's just]

365
00:13:41,639 --> 00:13:42,799
[a chance encounter.]

366
00:13:44,399 --> 00:13:45,360
[I was too naive.]

367
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,000
Sorry to

368
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:52,919
for keeping you waiting.

369
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:03,159
I thought

370
00:14:03,159 --> 00:14:03,919
you wouldn't wait for me.

371
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:05,960
I believe

372
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,759
you're a man of your word.

373
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,720
Do you always trust people so easily?

374
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:12,960
But this time, I trusted the right person,

375
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:13,799
didn't I?

376
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:17,480
This...

377
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:20,840
You're injured.

378
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:24,240
You're in trouble yourself.

379
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:26,120
You'd better take care of yourself.

380
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:27,360
It's almost dawn.

381
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:28,840
You should go back to your mansion.

382
00:14:29,679 --> 00:14:30,440
I'll tell you

383
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:31,360
if there's any new clue.

384
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:35,759
Young Master Lou,

385
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,039
you should be careful, too.

386
00:14:37,799 --> 00:14:38,879
Don't die before me.

387
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:41,159
Don't worry.

388
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:42,639
I'll be around

389
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,240
to collect my debt from you.

390
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,159
That would be best.

391
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:47,279
Farewell.

392
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,480
What's wrong?

393
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:04,480
Speak!

394
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,120
Where exactly is Xiao Wei hiding?

395
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:15,879
I'd like to see

396
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:18,080
how long you can keep this up.

397
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:29,639
Your Highness,

398
00:15:30,519 --> 00:15:31,879
you don't need to go to great lengths

399
00:15:31,879 --> 00:15:33,440
to find General Xiao.

400
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,440
He can show up himself.

401
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:37,799
You have a good idea?

402
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,720
If the news of General Xiao's

403
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,799
treachery is spread in the capital,

404
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,480
he will definitely show up

405
00:15:46,919 --> 00:15:49,279
to prove his innocence.

406
00:15:50,559 --> 00:15:52,600
As a general who has won many battles,

407
00:15:53,039 --> 00:15:53,879
he suddenly lost the battle

408
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:55,399
and returned to the capital overnight.

409
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,360
What would His Majesty think?

410
00:15:59,000 --> 00:15:59,759
Besides,

411
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:00,879
we've already received

412
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:02,279
the secret letter about his treason.

413
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,519
We'll have one of his subordinates

414
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:06,639
come forward and expose him.

415
00:16:07,639 --> 00:16:08,399
In that case,

416
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,879
what would Your Majesty decide?

417
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,559
The letter only vaguely mentioned the PM.

418
00:16:16,639 --> 00:16:18,639
Even if the Emperor punishes Xiao Wei,

419
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,200
it won't affect him.

420
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,440
To control him,

421
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,840
we failed to develop taro powder,

422
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,480
but now his daughter

423
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:29,080
obeys you.

424
00:16:30,279 --> 00:16:32,080
Xiao Wei and Prime Minister Shen are old friends.

425
00:16:32,759 --> 00:16:33,799
If General Xiao is in trouble,

426
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:35,720
Shen wouldn't stand by.

427
00:16:36,519 --> 00:16:37,279
At that time,

428
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,600
you can stir up trouble,

429
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:43,399
and Your Majesty will be suspicious of him.

430
00:16:45,759 --> 00:16:46,279
Fifteenth,

431
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,879
you're a good strategist.

432
00:16:49,919 --> 00:16:50,759
I'll do as you said.

433
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,159
Yes.

434
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,240
Sister,

435
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,119
what happened?

436
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,359
Who is this man?

437
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,519
Thank you for letting me in tonight.

438
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:17,319
He saved my life.

439
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,200
I must repay this favor.

440
00:17:19,519 --> 00:17:20,440
Please don't tell

441
00:17:20,759 --> 00:17:22,519
Father about this.

442
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,240
I can keep your secret.

443
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,279
But you should tell me

444
00:17:27,279 --> 00:17:28,359
what happened.

445
00:17:29,119 --> 00:17:29,880
I wanted to

446
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,640
visit you at the mansion.

447
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,240
But

448
00:17:33,519 --> 00:17:35,319
I was told that you were sick

449
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:36,079
and couldn't see me.

450
00:17:36,759 --> 00:17:37,759
I was kicked out.

451
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:39,680
Sister,

452
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,720
tell me the truth.

453
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,279
Did he bully you?

454
00:17:43,279 --> 00:17:43,839
No.

455
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,480
Don't worry.

456
00:17:46,799 --> 00:17:47,799
I'm fine.

457
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,200
But there are some things

458
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,400
I can't tell you and father yet.

459
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,519
I'll explain everything

460
00:17:54,039 --> 00:17:55,960
to you later.

461
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,160
Who's there?

462
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:06,640
My lord.

463
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,519
I thought there was a burglar in the house.

464
00:18:09,599 --> 00:18:11,359
I'm here to find something in my sister's room.

465
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:13,119
It's okay now.

466
00:18:13,599 --> 00:18:14,519
You can go back to rest.

467
00:18:14,519 --> 00:18:15,000
Yes.
